/// Structure describing the Vulkan 1.4 features that can be supported by an implementation.
///
/// C structure
/// [`VkPhysicalDeviceVulkan14Features`](https://docs.vulkan.org/refpages/latest/refpages/source/VkPhysicalDeviceVulkan14Features.html),
/// provided by Vulkan 1.4.
///
/// Extends [`VkDeviceCreateInfo`](DeviceCreateInfo) and
/// [`VkPhysicalDeviceFeatures2`](PhysicalDeviceFeatures2): their `push_next` accepts this
/// structure.
#[doc(alias = "VkPhysicalDeviceVulkan14Features")]
